#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>Kate comes with a nice set of plugins, providing simple\n"
"and advanced features of all sorts.</p>\n"
"<p>You can enable/disable plugins to suit your needs in the configuration "
"dialog,\n"
"choose <strong>Settings -&gt;configure</strong> to launch that.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate ligel gellek optionên firehî tê weşandin, yên ku karê asan û ne asan "
"karin bikin.</p>\n"
"<p>Ev optionên firehî tu kari di pencera çawdêrî vemirîni yan jî pêxi.\n"
"JIbo wê hilbijêre<strong>Danan-&gt; Kate çawdêrî...</strong>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:11
msgid ""
"<p>You can swap the characters on each side of the cursor just by pressing\n"
"<strong>Ctrl+T</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Heger tu bixwazi charaktera çep û rast ji Cursor biguhere\n"
"<strong>Strg+T</strong> dagire.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:17
msgid ""
"<p>You can export the current document as a HTML file, including\n"
"syntax highlighting.</p>\n"
"<p>Just choose <strong>File -&gt; Export -&gt; HTML...</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Livir tu kari Dokumenta aktîv wek HTML-Faîl export bikî, û ti kari\n"
"Lênerînên rengê Textê jî biguhere.</p>\n"
"<p>Jibo vê hilbijêre : <strong>Faîl -&gr; Exportkirin -&gt; HTML...</strong></p>"
"\n"

#: tips.cpp:24
msgid ""
"<p>You can split the Kate editor as many times as you like and\n"
"in either direction. Each frame has its own status bar and\n"
"can display any open document.</p>\n"
"<p>Just choose "
"<br><strong>View -&gt; Split [ Horizontal | Vertical ]</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tu kari pencera dîmenê ji Kate gellek caran jihevdu cihê bike evaya\n"
"estûnî û asoyî jî. Her nîvdîmenek lista statusa xwe heye û kari\n"
"her dokumentek vekkirî pêşkêşbike.</p>\n"
"<p>Jibo vê hilbijêre: "
"<br><strong>Dîmen -&gt; Cihêkirina estûnî/ asoyî </strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:32
msgid ""
"<p>You can drag the Tool views (<em>File List</em> and <em>File Selector</em>)\n"
"to any side that you want them in Kate, or stack them, or even tear them off "
"the\n"
"main window.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tu kari keresta dîmenan bikêşî (<em>Lista faîla</em> û <em>"
"Hilbijartina Faîl</em>)\n"
"li ser her pel û pencerekê Kate, tu kari wan liser hev yan jî komplet jihev "
"azad\n"
" bicîhbike.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:39
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>Kate has a built-in terminal emulator, just click on <strong>"
"\"Terminal\"</strong> at\n"
"the bottom to show or hide it as you desire.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Kate Terminalemulator heye yê ku têde avakirîye, hema ji xwere pê li "
"<strong>F7</strong>,\n"
" bike jibo ku tu wî pêxe yan vemrîne.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:45
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>Kate can highlight the current line with a\n"
"<table bgcolor=\"yellow\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" "
"width=\"100%\">"
"<tr>"
"<td>different\n"
"background color.<strong>|</strong></td></tr></table></p>\n"
"<p>You can set the color in the <em>Colors</em> page of the configuration\n"
"dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kate kari balkêşîyek rengî bide dêra berdest mîna \n"
"<table bgcolor=\"yellow\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" "
"width=\"100%\">"
"<tr>"
"<td>yêndin \n"
"paşereng <strong>|</strong></td></tr></table>pêşkêş bike.</p>\n"
"<p>Evaya kîjani, tu kari di erdê <em>Reng</em> pella Çawdêrî\n"
"sazbike.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:54
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can open the currently edited file in any other application from within\n"
"Kate.</p>\n"
"<p>Choose <strong>File -&gt; Open With</strong> for the list of programs\n"
"configured\n"
"for the document type. There is also an option <strong>Other...</strong> to\n"
"choose any application on your system.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari neha faîla aktîv ya amadekiri bi applîkationekê ligor daxwazê te ji "
"yên Kate \n"
"vekke.</p>\n"
"<p>Hilbijêre <strong>Faîl -&gt; Vekke bi</strong> jibo listekê ji programên ku "
", ji vî \n"
"typê Faîl re\n"
"hatine sazkirin. Li wê derê optionek din jî heye <strong>Hinekdin...</strong> "
"jibo \n"
"tu kari bi her applîkationek li ser sîstema xwe hilbijêre.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:64
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can configure the editor to always display the line numbers and/or\n"
"bookmark panes when started from the <strong>View Defaults</strong> "
"page of the\n"
"configuration dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari edîtor wissa sazbike, ku herdem hejmarên dêr Û/Yan \n"
"çarçêwa bookmark bête nîşandan, Evaya li ser Pella<strong>"
"Dîmenên standard</strong> yên \n"
" Dialoga Çawdêrî.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:71
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can download new or updated <em>Syntax highlight definitions</em> from\n"
"the <strong>Highlighting</strong> page in the configuration dialog.</p>\n"
"<p>Just click the <em>Download...</em> button on the <em>Highlight Modes</em>\n"
"tab (You have to be online, of course...).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Livir tu kari <em>pênaseyên lênerînên syntax</em> yên nuh yan aktualkirî \n"
"bar dabigrî ji <strong>Lênerîn</strong> di Dialoga Çawdêrî de.</p>\n"
"<p> JIbo wilo pê liser Mişkoka <em>dabigrî</em> bike liser Pella <em>"
"Modên Lênerîn</em>\n"
"(Jibo wê divê tu online be).</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can cycle through all open documents by pressing <strong>"
"Alt+Left</strong>\n"
"or <strong>Alt+Right</strong>. The next/previous document will immediately be "
"displayed\n"
"in the active frame.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari heri ser her Dokumentek vekkirî bi alîkarîya <strong>"
"Alt+Çep</strong> Yan <strong>Alt+Rast</strong> \n"
"Here ser dokumenta bûrî/yatir îca wê ev bête nîşankirin di frame a \n"
"aktîv de.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:86
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can do cool sed-like regular expression replacements using <em>"
"Command Line</em>.</p>\n"
"<p>For example, press <strong>F7</strong> and enter <code>"
"s /oldtext/newtext/g</code>\n"
"to replace &quot;oldtext&quot; with &quot;newtext&quot; throughout the current\n"
"line.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tu kari Text têke cihê teteke din de bi Styla SED de, bikar bîne <em>"
"Edîtkirin \n"
"Kommand</em>.</p>\n"
"<p> Exampil pê li <strong>Strg+M</strong> bike binivîse <code>"
"s/texta kevin/texta nuh/g</code> \n"
", jibo ku &quot;texta nuh&quot; cihê &quot;texta kevin &quot; bigre di lînya, "
"ku\n"
"Cursor neha lisere.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:94
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can repeat your last search by just pressing <strong>F3</strong>, or\n"
"<strong>Shift+F3</strong> if you want to search backwards.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari bang lêgerîna xweî dawî ke, Heger tu pê li <strong>F3</strong> "
"xe jibo lêgerîna bipêşveçûn, yan <strong>Umschalt+F3</strong> "
"jibo Lêgherîna bipaşveçûn.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:100
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can filter the files displayed in the <em>File Selector</em> tool view.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Simply enter your filter in the filter entry at the bottom, for example:\n"
"<code>*.html *.php</code> if you only want to see HTML and PHP files in the\n"
"current folder.</p>\n"
"<p>The File Selector will even remember your filters for you.</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari Faîlan filterbike, heger tu<em>Faîl hilbijêr</em> TOol dîmen.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Bi asanî Filterê xwe li erdêî binî binîvise, Exampil\n"
"<code>*.html *.php</code> Heger tu bitenê HTML- und PHP-Faîlan dixwaze\n"
"bibîne.</p>\n"
"<p>Pencera Faîl hilbijêr filtera te jî diki bîra xwe.</strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:110
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can have two views - or even more - of the same document in Kate. "
"Editing\n"
"in either will be reflected in both.</p>\n"
"<p>So if you find yourself scrolling up and down to look at text at the other\n"
"end of a document, just press <strong>Ctrl+Shift+T</strong> to split\n"
"horizontally.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p> Tu kari yek yan gellek dîmenan di dokumêntekê di Kate bikarbîne .\n"
"Guhertên di her pencerekê bikî wê bê xwûyakirin.</p>\n"
"<p>Yanî heger tu bixwaze li gellek cîya di dokumentekê de kar bike di "
"katekê(demekê) de \n"
"pê li <strong>Strg+Shift+T</strong> bike, jibodîmen\n"
"asoyî bête cihêkirin.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:119
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>Press <strong>F8</strong> or <strong>Shift+F8</strong> to switch to the\n"
"next/previous frame.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pê li <strong>F8</strong> yan <strong>Shift+F8</strong> bike jibo \n"
" tu here ser nîvpencera ya bê yan ya bûrî.</p>\n"

